<title>USA: Gerber Scientific sees Q1 gain from UK award.</title>
<headline>Gerber Scientific sees Q1 gain from UK award.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH WINDSON, Conn. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gerber Scientific Inc said Thursday that it will record a gain of $0.04 a share in its first fiscal quarter, ending July 31, as a result of damages awarded its Gerber Garment Technology unit by a British court.</p>
<p>The company said that the court has upheld, on appeal, a $3.1 million award from Lectra Systemes SA in a patent infringement suit.</p>
</text>
